caption: Effortless Grace
tradition-component: effortless-grace

Combat maneuvers that normally cost FP cost none, and extended combat causes no FP loss merely from fighting. Independent fatigue from environment, deprivation, travel, poison, disease, and similar causes is unaffected. Any legally accessible Martial-origin trait with an FP cost may permanently buy off that FP cost by paying the normal point difference; other costs and restrictions remain.
